摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Switch between Chat and Agent without leaving your DeepSeek Harness session.","id":"gh:1335593012","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-autonomy","slug":"JinkaiLiu/dsh-autonomy","topics":["agent","autonomy","chat-mode","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Switch between Chat and Agent without leaving your DeepSeek Harness session."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-autonomy"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Switch between Chat and Agent in the same DeepSeek Harness session.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`dsh-autonomy` is a DeepSeek Harness plugin that adds a **Chat | Agent** switch above the Web input."},{"id":"p5s2","text":" Discuss an approach in Chat, switch to Agent when you're ready to execute, and keep the conversatio"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" an approach in Chat, switch to Agent when you're ready to execute, and keep the conversation going."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"*Chat → Agent → Chat, in the same session. Your unsent draft stays in place.*"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Mode | Use it for | Behavior |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| **Chat** | Questions, explanations, planning | Answers in text. Tools are hidden from the model an"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"d tool execution is blocked. |\n| **Agent** | Investigation, file edits, commands | Uses DSH's normal"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" tools and agent loop, subject to its existing permissions. |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Quick start · Configuration · Compatibility · Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"You need a working DeepSeek Harness setup and Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0`. Install the plugin int"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"o the Web profile, then start DSH Web:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"These commands use the official CLI through `npx`; a global `dsh` installation is optional. The inst"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"all command adds both the host plugin and its Web control to the profile."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"If DSH Web is already running, stop it with `Ctrl+C` and start it again so it can load the plugin."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Open a session and click **Chat** or **Agent** above the input. You can also use slash commands:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The default mode is **Agent**. Each session remembers its own selection across page refreshes, DSH r"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"estarts, and session resumes. A fork inherits the mode recorded in its session history. Switching ke"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"eps your model, preset, conversation history, and unsent draft."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"You can switch during an active turn. The change applies immediately to tool calls that have not pas"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"sed the execution check."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> **Already-running operations:** selecting Chat lets a tool that has already started finish; it can"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"not undo earlier changes. Use DSH's **Stop** control if you want to cancel the active turn."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Install from a local checkout"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Requires pnpm `11.7.0`. Replace `/absolute/path/to/dsh-autonomy` with the path to your cloned direct"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ires pnpm `11.7.0`. Replace `/absolute/path/to/dsh-autonomy` with the path to your cloned directory."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Chat mode restricts the session's tools, removes all tool definitions from the final model request—i"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ncluding DSH's reserved Code Mode tool—and rejects tool calls at execution time. A short system inst"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ruction asks the model to answer directly and suggest switching to Agent when a task requires action"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"uction asks the model to answer directly and suggest switching to Agent when a task requires action."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Agent mode restores DSH's usual tool access and agent loop. DSH's sandbox and permission policies co"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ntinue to apply in both modes."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Every successful switch is saved through DSH's built-in session command log. The Web control and hos"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"t behavior use that same record to recover the selected mode."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Chat can reduce token use by omitting tool definitions and avoiding autonomous tool loops. It does n"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ot impose a token budget or usage cap: conversation history, prompt size, model output, and provider"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" pricing still affect the cost."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"No configuration is needed. To start sessions in Chat mode when they have no saved selection, update"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" the installed `autonomy` entry in your Web profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Option | Default | Purpose |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| `defaultMode` | `agent` | Mode used when the session has no saved selection. Accepts `chat` or `ag"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ent`. |\n| `chatGuidance` | Built-in Chat instruction | System instruction added in Chat mode. |\n| `d"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"enyMessage` | Built-in tool denial message | Error returned when a tool call is blocked in Chat mode"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"Message` | Built-in tool denial message | Error returned when a tool call is blocked in Chat mode. |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Changing `defaultMode` keeps existing sessions' saved selections. Customizing the messages does not "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"change the tool restrictions."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"For `dsh-autonomy 0.1.6`, the development baseline is DSH `0.2.0-rc.2`; the supported newer releases"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" include DSH `0.2.1-rc.5`, `0.2.2-alpha.2`, and `0.2.2-alpha.3`, alongside the previously tested API"},{"id":"p35s3","text":" families. The package declares its supported DSH versions through `engines.dsh`. See the changelog "},{"id":"p35s4","text":"for release verification."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Earlier DSH releases covered by CI"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- `0.1.0-rc.6` and `0.1.0-rc.7`\n- `0.1.1-rc.2`\n- `0.1.2-rc.1`\n- `0.1.7-alpha.2` and `0.1.7-rc.2`"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Scheduled CI also checks the exact versions published under DSH's `latest`, `next`, and `alpha` tags"},{"id":"p38s2","text":". This plugin is an MVP for DSH's developer preview; upstream changes may require plugin updates."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Symptom | What to check |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| The switch is missing | Confirm you installed into the `web` profile, restart DSH Web, then refres"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"h the browser. |\n| `unknown command: /autonomy` | The browser control loaded but the host plugin did"},{"id":"p41s3","text":" not. Stop old DSH processes and restart the same profile. |\n| The default port is occupied | Stop t"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"he older process or use `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh web --port 3081`. |\n| A GitHub-source install asks for"},{"id":"p41s5","text":" build approval | Allow the package's `prepare` script in that profile, or install the prebuilt npm "},{"id":"p41s6","text":"roval | Allow the package's `prepare` script in that profile, or install the prebuilt npm release. |"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"If the issue persists, open an issue with the DSH and plugin versions, install command, active profi"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"le, operating system, and first relevant host error. For security reports, follow SECURITY.md."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Remove the plugin from the profile where you installed it, then restart DSH Web:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Historical `/autonomy` commands remain in the session log and have no effect after removal."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## Permissions and data"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"The plugin records mode changes in DSH's existing session log and creates no separate database or co"},{"id":"p48s2","text":"nfiguration directory. The host plugin does not make network requests, collect telemetry, access pro"},{"id":"p48s3","text":"vider credentials, or read or write workspace files. The browser control sends mode commands to the "},{"id":"p48s4","text":"local DSH command service; each command affects only its selected session."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"Like other Cordis plugins, it runs with the privileges of the DSH host process. Review the source be"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"fore installing it in an environment with sensitive data."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
